1
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:19,180
Giữa nhân gian, bao người qua đời tôi,
In this vast world, countless souls have passed through my life.

2
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:24,280
May mắn thay... người năm ấy là anh.
How fortunate I was... that the one I met that year was you.

3
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:31,020
Dẫu đã qua bao thăng trầm năm tháng,
Though we have weathered the ups and downs of time,

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:37,480
Tình vẫn nguyên vẹn... như thuở ban đầu.
Our love remains untouched... as pure as when it first began.

5
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:44,060
Một đời người, tri âm đâu dễ gặp,
In a lifetime, a kindred soul is rarely found.

6
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:50,260
Giữa biển người... ta tìm thấy đời nhau.
Yet amid a sea of people... we found our way into each other's lives.

7
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:57,160
Chẳng cần thế gian hiểu lời ta nói,
We need not have the world understand our words,

8
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:03,180
Chỉ cần lòng người... thấu được lòng nhau.
So long as our hearts... understand one another.

9
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:09,780
Tình nào có phân chia bờ cõi,
Love knows no borders or boundaries.

10
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:16,600
Thương một người đâu phải chuyện đúng sai.
Loving someone is not a question of right or wrong.

11
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:23,600
Dẫu cách nhau muôn trùng sông núi,
Though countless mountains and rivers may lie between us,

12
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:29,100
Tiếng lòng này... vẫn vọng đến phương xa!
The voice of our hearts... will still echo across distant lands!

13
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:36,920
Dẫu khác nhau tiếng nói quê hương,
Though we speak in different mother tongues,

14
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:39,880
Vẫn cùng rơi lệ trước một chữ tình.
We still shed the same tears at the very thought of love.

15
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:43,340
Muôn dặm núi sông, muôn màu thế giới,
Across boundless mountains and rivers, through a world of countless colors,

16
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:46,320
Một tiếng lòng ngân vọng khắp nhân gian.
A single voice of the heart echoes throughout humanity.

17
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,840
山海相隔，深情無界，
Mountains and seas divide us, but our love knows no bounds.

18
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:52,940
天涯咫尺，心有靈犀。
Though worlds apart, our hearts understand each other as if side by side.

19
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:55,860
萬里共鳴，情歸天地，
Our hearts resonate across ten thousand miles, our love at home in heaven and earth.

20
00:01:55,860 --> 00:02:02,080
人間有愛，何懼風雨。
With love in this world, why fear the wind and rain?

21
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:09,560
수많은 사람 중에 너를 만났어.
Among countless people, I found you.

22
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:15,360
남은 생도 너와 함께 걷고 싶어.
I want to walk beside you for the rest of my life.

23
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:21,700
広い世界で、君に出会えた。
In this vast world, I was fortunate to meet you.

24
00:02:21,760 --> 00:02:27,700
これからも、君と歩いてゆきたい。
From now on, I want to keep walking beside you.

25
00:02:27,700 --> 00:02:31,320
願同你一齊行到白頭，
I wish to walk beside you until our hair turns white.

26
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:34,560
有你喺身邊就已經足夠。
Having you by my side is already enough.

27
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:38,100
Di dunia seluas ini, kutemukan dirimu.
In a world this vast, I found you.

28
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:41,180
Hingga rambut memutih, kuingin bersamamu.
Until our hair turns white, I want to be with you.

29
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:46,380
Across the oceans, beneath the same sky,

30
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:52,660
Love speaks a language no words can define.

31
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:58,680
Xin cho người được yêu người mình chọn,
May everyone be free to love the one their heart has chosen.

32
00:02:59,860 --> 00:03:06,400
Xin cho tình chẳng khuất bóng thời gian.
May love never fade beneath the shadow of time.

33
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:13,240
Dẫu đời người chỉ một lần được sống,
For we are given but one lifetime in this world,

34
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:19,080
